{
  "slug": "parallax",
  "name": "Parallax",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Parallax is an autopilot for long, complex tasks in Claude Code. Append `parallaxthink` to any prompt, and at the end of each turn Parallax spawns an advisory agent in an isolated context,\nfinds regions the mission implicitly required but the agent never addressed, and surfaces one back into the turn. The loop continues until the task is flawlessly done — turning a single\nprompt into the equivalent of several manual follow-ups, without any extra effort from you.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `commit` (전체 변경사항을 git commit 합니다), `translate-prompt` (한국어 프롬프트(.ko.md)를 영어 버전(.md)으로 번역합니다), `translate-readme` (한국어 버전 README로 영어 원본 README를 작성합니다)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `mermaid-mcp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install parallax@claude-community` from `clomia/claude-automata`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "mcp": 1
  },
